<title>UK: Telkom at $32.75 in London at 0826 GMT.</title>
<headline>Telkom at $32.75 in London at 0826 GMT.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON</dateline>
<text>
<p>PT Telkom traded at $32.75 and London at 0826 GMT on Thursday. It recorded the day's low of $32.625 and the day's high of $32.875</p>
<p>Its previous close on Wednesday $33.00. One ADS represents 20 ordinary shares -- Jakarta newsroom (Tel: 6221-3846364).</p>
</text>
